      <h1 class="article-title">The Second Apology</h1>
      <p class="article-dek faith-doc-dek">Justin Martyr &middot; c. 155–161</p>
      
      <p class="faith-doc-description">A shorter defense of Christianity prompted by the unjust execution of Christians in Rome. Justin argues that the Logos (Word/Reason) present in all people finds its fullness in Christ, making Christians the true philosophers.</p>
